      "cooked": "<p>So I might be needing better glasses but there used to be a drop down menu at the bottom of the main forum that allowed you to select the option \"Mark all threads read\" (or something like that) but I can't see it any longer. Is there a way to achieve this same thing?</p><p>When I log in I just go to \"New &amp; updated topics\", click on the ones that interest me and mark the rest as read.</p>",
