      "created_at": "2014-03-29T14:44:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I read threads by going into them, reading them, then using the Back button to return to the thread list for that section of the forum. When I do this, the thread gets marked as read without my needing to do anything. Once I've read all the threads I want to, then I'll use the \"mark as read\" thingy to clear any threads that I'm not interested in reading...which is practically none of them apart from the Events section, usually.</p>",
