      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-03T22:04:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"lynkfox\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/48/1997_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lynkfox:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>while were talking about board features, id love a Admin Tracker like blizzards blue tracker or riots res tracker. to be able to easily pull up all of christophers posts would be awesoooommee … for the wiki of course. yup. just that. im not a stalker fan or anything. nope.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Why stop there?&nbsp; On most forum software I'm familiar with (PHPBB and SimpleMachines being the main ones), you can just click on a user's profile and find all of their posts, whether they're an admin or not.&nbsp; I'm sure it'd be possible to make that happen here.</p>",
